    "specialCards10": "Card 10: Clears all cards from the table.",
    "rule4Title": "Sequences of 4 cards",
    "rule4Text": "When you have 4 cards with the same number or letter, you can clear the table. Additionally, you can play the last card that completes a sequence of 4 cards, even outside your turn.",
    "rule5Title": "How to draw cards",
    "rule5Text": "You never draw cards directly, but you must always keep at least 3 cards in hand while there are cards available to draw.",
    "rule6Title": "End of the game",
    "rule6Text": "When there are no more cards to draw, you must play the face-up cards you still have. When those are gone, you randomly choose one of the face-down cards to play.",
